# PART 1 — THE REQUIRED ARCHITECTURE

## 1. One dynamic route for all public content pages

Use the Next.js App Router with this route:

`src/app/[[...slug]]/page.tsx`

This is the only page route for the public, content-driven website.

It must handle:

- `/`
- `/about`
- `/services`
- `/services/website-design`
- `/services/web-development`
- `/services/website-redesign`
- `/services/ecommerce`
- `/services/website-maintenance`
- `/services/cms-integration`
- `/services/seo`
